{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Paw Wallet 是一款集中管理寵物疫苗、獸醫就診與健康紀錄的 App，適合多寵家庭、新手主人及經常外遊的寵物家長；現時<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，原價 US $0.99。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-279.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>寵物健康紀錄集中管理</h2>\n<p>用戶可為多隻寵物建立健康檔案，記錄疫苗日期、診所資料及接種卡照片，並設定到期提醒；亦可保存每次獸醫就診、手術與費用，加入自訂提醒及覆診日期。內建地圖可尋找附近診所，健康紀錄可匯出 PDF 或 ZIP，離線亦可查閱，資料僅儲存在裝置本地。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-221-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-222-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-223-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-224-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-225-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-226-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Paw Wallet</li><li>應用類別：Utilities</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/paw-wallet/id6760319582?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T00:04:17.452688+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":258,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T23:56:03+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T04:57:27.416896+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T23:57:46.787492+00:00","content_hash":"7602740bfcef8621718c191ee7b8ee49328bc88e076497844dd9c182e2309017","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}